Track: Android TV Client - Repair & Acceptance Recovery

Summary:
- rewired Mediarr TV to activate discovered endpoints at runtime and persist emulator-safe fallback behavior
- replaced fixed-size catalog loading with paginated aggregation and added series detail episode mapping for playable TV entries
- moved the Android TV UI onto a readable TV Material theme, repaired resume/player navigation, and added an image proxy route for TVDB artwork
- added Android unit coverage for endpoint resolution, paginated catalog fetches, series detail mapping, and episode playback session creation

