Why:
The committed Android TV branch could build but still missed core acceptance requirements: discovery never changed the active runtime endpoint, the catalog was capped at 40 items, series cards attempted episode playback with a series id, and resume/navigation flows were not TV-safe. This repair addresses those functional gaps while preserving the existing branch foundation.
